: "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_28369212172730796_5258581881626541407_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CNIYYn1VTh4Q7kNvwGmXf7e&_nc_oc=AdoBxE0x1SSqaPEery3bfWV9H0pqa1SFGIg3VxUXcb1BaDSQ7K4KDE45qLG-KS0vXy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP1B2uCzofmheEdDg8zZdfhLU_mv8utAsyh_fJ8Q6Uy8A&oe=6AE5EE87"}, {"file_name": "store-04-source-assembly.png", "id": "1548633643226364", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4SJD_q7u8YYQ7kNvwFgewln&_nc_oc=AdrricJt5q7a4RJLMYJVrLkQVFIsBGJnebPcXtSw6rIZJ7ux12ZB1C3CDl4PfJGV1kM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNeez_gSz3Py5CpnHYQ0P615QtbIZc7g4dPwXlxihmQrA&oe=6AE5ED20"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w4RhG-RDQL8Q7kNvwFAHvsX&_nc_oc=Adp7DW8yZnV3ocihaarHJu8Fq1Jj64dLwE8_XnQd93wwmTx8MvwxsAJ_smA8stWspn0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMdy8KRWbpSnttgXzmT5jkKVg8TjAYJUrAuVD558DwINA&oe=6AE5F6A2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4018zVjpYtwQ7kNvwGSUgFA&_nc_oc=AdoVKfOUTq3Y_xuM8ond1VkP_Ien7hMQBcqu7KRDCsTG31GqzI7HerAD0i9oqZXkXrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPEvT5I9O4z9CtMgSbdXvXYdjdyrAE2Xts-ObBt_rlvpg&oe=6AE5E541"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FRy1Y2vbpSUQ7kNvwGMshFh&_nc_oc=Adqm8lNddR0xks3Gt9HmjWgsfFe3dPuCrN87024Ft-MC7YrsVujUB4L4HIOGqr5KWEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMsjf8pw-1Z9ExvFGnkZQpRhyfYMlC7-q1RtdNODz_2ZA&oe=6AE60B92"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer